# Fixora Core

- Frontend only (FixoraF). Backend is FIXORAB — do not implement API here.
- Start sessions: `docs/AI_HANDOFF.md` → `docs/TASK_BOARD.md` → `docs/design/README.md`.
- Use **yarn** (`yarn dev`, `yarn build`, `yarn lint`).
- GraphQL: `docs/FRONTEND_API.md` — never guess operation names.
- UI skill: apply `.cursor/skills/fixora-ui/SKILL.md` for all UI/theme work.
- P3-02 skills: `fixora-theme`, `fixora-ui-kit`, `fixora-navbar` in `.cursor/skills/`.
